[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; The Code Runner's rung above. Same components, same weapon, same shared `code_runner.tres` — the
; trail is written in that resource as what changes, the way the Recursion family's elder rung is —
; and its own sprite, which draws the trail as well as the body, because the patch on the floor is
; the half of this enemy the player has to see coming.
;
; Untinted, unlike the Code Runner it extends. That scene borrows the Memory Leech's silhouette and
; tints it violet; this one has a wedge of its own, pointed the way it strafes, with the compile
; lane's amber behind it.

